{"id":"fogueira","lemma":"fogueira","pos":"noun","rank":2978,"glosses":["bonfire (pile of burning wood)","stake (post one is bound to for execution by burning)"],"ipa":"/foˈɡe(j).ɾɐ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"fogueiras"},"examples":[{"text":"Vou fazer uma fogueira.","en":"I'm going to build a fire.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/852126","words":[{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to create"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},null]},{"text":"A fogueira ainda está acesa.","en":"The campfire is still burning.","words":[{"g":"the / to"},null,{"g":"still"},{"g":"is","l":"estar"},{"g":"lit","l":"aceso"}]},{"text":"Cantamos em volta da fogueira.","en":"We sang around the campfire.","words":[{"g":"to sing","l":"cantar"},null,null,{"g":"of the"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"around"]]},{"text":"Estava frio, então nós acendemos uma fogueira.","en":"It was cold, so we lit a fire.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"having low temperatures"},{"g":"so, then"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"to light","l":"acender"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},null]},{"text":"Tom jogou mais lenha na fogueira.","en":"Tom threw another log on the fire.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to play","l":"jogar"},{"g":"more"},{"g":"firewood"},{"g":"in the"},null]}]}